  <h1>Object <em>pronouns</em></h1>
  <p class="standfirst">Avoid repeating names and things: <span class="ex">Call me</span>, <span class="ex">I know her</span>, <span class="ex">Give it to them</span>, and <span class="ex">Come with us</span>.</p>
  <div class="meta-row">
    <span class="tag">45–55 min core</span>
    <span class="tag">me / him / her / them</span>
    <span class="tag">after verbs and prepositions</span>
    <span class="tag">15–20 min optional listening and retrieval</span>
  </div>

  <div class="lesson-flow" aria-label="Lesson flow">
